    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the cross-bleed sensing installation at the bleed monitoring computer, with the single and dual pressure sensing arrangements shown as alternates on the manifold duct.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the cross-bleed pressure and temperature sensing installation and the bleed monitoring computer input card, covering the single and dual sensing standards.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn looking forward at the cross-bleed manifold with the wing root fairing removed. The alternates at item 10 are the two manifold ducts: the dual sensing duct carries a second sensor boss and is not interchangeable with the single sensing duct. The pressure sensor at item 30 is ordered in quantity one for a single sensing installation and quantity two for a dual sensing installation. The clamp set at item 50 is renewed at every position because the duct wall thickness changes locally around the second boss."
    },
